{{Quote|I did overhear some troopers talking about the Jedha system. If there's any special cargo, it probably came from there.|[[Mich Matt]], to [[Saw Gerrera]]|<ref name="Name">{{Rebels|In the Name of the Rebellion}}</ref>}}
The '''Jedha system''',<ref name="Galactic Atlas" /> also called the '''NaJedha system''',<ref name="DoR">''[[Dawn of Rebellion]]''</ref> was a [[star system]]<ref name="Galactic Atlas" /> located in the [[Terrabe sector]]<ref name="RO World Locations" /> that contained the [[planet]] [[NaJedha]]<ref name="Visual Guide" /> and its [[moon]], [[Jedha]].<ref name="Galactic Atlas" />

